{% for kernel in lanes %}
The {{ kernel.numpy_call }} row is NumPy's own loops, which hotkernels calls
for small arrays without NumPy's call path: a + b, a > 0, np.exp(a), x += y.
Its "Left to NumPy" counts every other ufunc call. It is not counted on the
first line.

